1
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:13,120
Let's get something to drink later.

2
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,919
Sounds good.

3
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:14,400
Anda.

4
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:14,599
Hello.

5
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,479
Anda's back.

6
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,719
Anda, long time no see.

7
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:18,319
Anda, you're back from Africa?

8
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,639
Yeah, I'm back.

9
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,560
Captain, Sister Luo Xi!

10
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:35,080
You two are finally here!

11
00:02:35,319 --> 00:02:36,759
Come, let me show you around

12
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,759
our training base.

13
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:39,120
Shen Yu.

14
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,280
Welcome, Captain.

15
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:43,879
Welcome, Luo Xi.

16
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:44,599
Hello.

17
00:02:45,439 --> 00:02:46,960
This is our newest training ground.

18
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,319
Let me show you around.

19
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,360
Great! Everyone's full of energy!

20
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,039
They sure are.

21
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:55,120
This area right here

22
00:02:55,159 --> 00:02:56,680
is our electronic shooting range.

23
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,479
It's equipped with

24
00:02:58,479 --> 00:03:00,439
the latest electronic simulation tech.

25
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:03,719
Where did you recruit all these people?

26
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:06,719
Most of them are military veterans,

27
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:08,840
and some are sports academy graduates.

28
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,400
Here at Zhong An, we welcome

29
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,639
all kinds of talent.

30
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:14,120
Especially someone like you, Luo Xi,

31
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,960
both good-looking and professional.

32
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,879
You flatter me.

33
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,919
Just telling the truth.

34
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:24,680
Breathe a third slower than normal.

35
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,280
Come on, again.

36
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,120
Absorb the recoil back. That's it.

37
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:30,639
Relax your shoulders. Mind your breathing.

38
00:03:38,919 --> 00:03:39,719
A bullseye!

39
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,680
Incredible! Thank you for the coaching.

40
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,479
There are no shortcuts to shooting.

41
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:46,319
Only years of dedicated practice.

42
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,240
Come on, keep practicing.

43
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:51,080
So, Captain, Sister Luo Xi,

44
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,080
interested in joining Zhong An?

45
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,240
Me? Forget it.

46
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,759
I'm too old.

47
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:01,680
You're still in your prime!

48
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:07,240
Come on, Luo Xi, time to eat!

49
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,159
Coming!

50
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,599
Here you go.

51
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:14,080
My favorite again, scrambled eggs with green peppers!

52
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,920
Who's that?

53
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,879
Who could that be?

54
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,319
Talk about bad timing.

55
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,199
Uncle Qu.

56
00:04:28,439 --> 00:04:29,279
Have you eaten yet?

57
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:30,439
Not yet.

58
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,120
Perfect timing, then!

59
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:34,360
Hurry and sit down.

60
00:04:35,199 --> 00:04:36,000
Sit, sit.

61
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,920
What kind of book are you reading?

62
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:41,079
Grappling and combat,

63
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:43,040
unarmed combat,

64
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:45,160
security guard training...

65
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,720
Are you really planning to apply for Zhong An?

66
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:50,120
What, you think I'm joking?

67
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,519
I'm dead serious.

68
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,319
So how's your training going?

69
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,439
How's it going? Well...

70
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:58,120
I think it's pretty decent,

71
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,519
except for one issue.

72
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:00,800
Thanks, Uncle Qu.

73
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,399
Sure.

74
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,600
The 3,000-meter run.

75
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:05,040
Zhong An requires it in under 11 minutes.

76
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,519
That's pretty tough.

77
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:07,319
And where are you at?

78
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:09,839
Pushing myself as hard as I can, barely...

79
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,519
15 minutes.

80
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,879
You? No chance.

81
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,160
Just eat.

82
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:15,839
Hey!

83
00:05:15,839 --> 00:05:18,720
Don't you underestimate me.

84
00:05:18,839 --> 00:05:20,279
People have untapped potential.

85
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:21,680
Once my potential is unleashed,

86
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,439
who knows?

87
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,040
I might finish in nine minutes!

88
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,240
Eat your food.

89
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,040
Right, Uncle Qu?

90
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,720
Uncle Qu, after dinner, give me some tips

91
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,160
and pass on some of your

92
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,040
skills.

93
00:05:33,959 --> 00:05:35,279
Running doesn't need coaching.

94
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,519
No, but there's hand-to-hand combat!

95
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,160
Eat, eat, eat.

96
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:41,120
Train after you've eaten.

97
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:51,240
Number 276, Zuo Feichen, get ready.

98
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:03,519
Ready

99
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,519
Go

100
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:27,360
Zuo Feichen, passed.

101
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:39,720
Everyone here has passed the written exam

102
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,279
and the physical fitness test.

103
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:42,920
Today,

104
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:45,240
we're testing your combat talent

105
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,360
and your reflexes.

106
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,680
Don't feel pressured.

107
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,600
Just relax

108
00:06:49,879 --> 00:06:51,560
and go all out, okay?

109
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,319
Who wants to go first?

110
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:55,040
I will.

111
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:58,120
Boss Zuo, what are you doing here?

112
00:06:58,759 --> 00:07:00,079
I'm trying out for Zhong An.

113
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,959
All right.

114
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,519
Then, Candidate 276,

115
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:06,920
let me ask you: Why do you want to join Zhong An?

116
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,480
Because back in Africa,

117
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:10,160
I saw Zhong An's people with my own eyes

118
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:13,120
risk their lives to protect our compatriots.

119
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,720
So I hope

120
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,879
I can become someone like them,

121
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:19,879
protecting our compatriots with my own life.

122
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,120
Excellent.

123
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:24,959
All right, let's begin.

124
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:26,639
Yes, sir.

125
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,720
You're ruthless, even throwing kicks.

126
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:37,679
Take it seriously.

127
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:47,480
All right, that's it.

128
00:08:47,879 --> 00:08:48,879
I'm exhausted.

129
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:53,279
Good speed and reflexes,

130
00:08:53,639 --> 00:08:55,320
just lacking a bit in technique.

131
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:58,480
All right, judges, please score.

132
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,840
Six point five.

133
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,039
Seven.

134
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,000
Six.

135
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,919
The final score is six point five.

136
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:12,279
Boss Zuo.

137
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,519
Welcome to Zhong An.

138
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,480
I've called you dozens of times!

139
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,080
What were you doing last night?

140
00:09:46,799 --> 00:09:49,159
I was getting over jet lag. I—

141
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:53,759
It was only eight calls, not dozens.

142
00:09:54,039 --> 00:09:55,480
You silly child, you...

143
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:58,840
That's basically the same thing.

144
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,120
Tell your mom.

145
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,639
This time...

146
00:10:03,519 --> 00:10:04,279
did that Wei Tian...

147
00:10:04,279 --> 00:10:05,919
come back with you?

148
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,919
I barely even know him!

149
00:10:09,919 --> 00:10:11,720
Stop bringing him up.

150
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:16,120
Did you two have a fight?

151
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:17,919
No.

152
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:21,279
I'm going to take a shower. Bye!

153
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,679
Listen to me, I—

154
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:30,279
"Wei Tian, Wei Tian"... I'm dead tired.

155
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:37,279
Come try the new coffee beans I bought.

156
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:41,840
Looks great.

157
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,360
How is it?

158
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,519
It's delicious!

159
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:51,080
I can taste real affection in it.

160
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,960
By the way, you just joined Zhong An like that?

161
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,919
What do you mean "like that"?

162
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,919
I passed physical tests, combat tests,

163
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,519
and so many other tests

164
00:11:04,799 --> 00:11:05,960
before joining Zhong An!

165
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:09,279
Didn't know you were that capable.

166
00:11:09,679 --> 00:11:10,519
Of course!

167
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:13,120
How could I embarrass myself in front of my goddess?

168
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,960
Anda said he'd drop by.

169
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,240
What's taking him so long?

170
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,559
Anda is coming?

171
00:11:22,879 --> 00:11:24,960
All right, then I'll head back first.

172
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:25,919
You two take your time.

173
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:28,279
Okay, I won't see you out.

174
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,279
Don't worry about it, I can see myself out.

175
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:32,279
Close the door behind you!

176
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,759
Anda.

177
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:39,919
Where are you?

178
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:43,480
Sister Luo Xi, I'm buying some things right now.

179
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,519
I'll be right there!

180
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,039
Here comes the food.

181
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,600
Go ahead and eat.

182
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:55,519
Um, Wei Tian doesn't like cilantro.

183
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,639
Eat up.

184
00:12:07,879 --> 00:12:09,039
Help yourselves, everyone.

185
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:11,279
Honestly, Plato wouldn't be where it is today

186
00:12:11,279 --> 00:12:12,840
without everyone's tremendous help.

187
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:13,720
Thank you, everyone.

188
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,279
What do you think, Ms. Dan?

189
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:19,120
With help from our website,

190
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:21,720
Plato's selection this year to the

191
00:12:21,759 --> 00:12:24,159
Global Hospitality Council Presidium

192
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,080
shouldn't be a problem, right?

193
00:12:25,080 --> 00:12:27,879
Absolutely, thank you so much for your help, Mr. Sun.

194
00:12:27,879 --> 00:12:29,000
Thanks to your help, Mr. Sun,

195
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,200
our hotel has received a lot more bookings.

196
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:31,919
Thank you.

197
00:12:33,399 --> 00:12:34,960
I've noticed lately

198
00:12:35,279 --> 00:12:37,720
that your hotel's ranking on our site

199
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,559
has slipped a bit.

200
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,799
No worries.

201
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:43,840
I can quietly bump it back up for you.

202
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,960
Mr. Sun, there's no need to alter it.

203
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,440
You see, we at Plato

204
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,840
have always believed in being realistic.

205
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,840
If there are shortcomings,

206
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,559
we should know so we can improve.

207
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:54,480
Thank you, Mr. Sun.

208
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:58,320
Just saying thanks isn't very sincere, is it?

209
00:12:58,519 --> 00:12:59,320
How about this:

210
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:00,759
finish this glass—

211
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,519
no, drink both glasses,

212
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,720
and show me your sincerity.

213
00:13:06,879 --> 00:13:07,600
All right.

214
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,159
Cheers, cheers!

215
00:13:17,399 --> 00:13:20,679
Don't worry, if you drink too much, I'll take you home.

216
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,720
Everyone, please eat. Don't be shy.

217
00:13:24,399 --> 00:13:25,039
All right.

218
00:13:25,039 --> 00:13:29,159
Come on, let's all propose a toast to Ms. Dan!

219
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,679
Great, sounds good. Cheers!

220
00:13:30,679 --> 00:13:32,759
Thank you, everyone. Thank you.

221
00:13:51,919 --> 00:13:52,720
Is it good?

222
00:13:52,919 --> 00:13:53,720
It's good.

223
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,799
Ms. Dan.

224
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:08,480
Anda, are you free to come see me right now?

225
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,159
What is it?

226
00:14:09,399 --> 00:14:12,159
Aren't you at a banquet at the hotel?

227
00:14:12,519 --> 00:14:13,320
Yeah.

228
00:14:14,039 --> 00:14:15,519
Mr. Sun from Qifeng Travel...

229
00:14:15,519 --> 00:14:16,759
...keeps drinking with me.

230
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,080
I've had a bit too much.

231
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:20,039
I'm worried something might go wrong.

232
00:14:20,039 --> 00:14:21,519
If you're free, could you come over?

233
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,759
Sure, I'll be right there.

234
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:25,840
Great, thanks.

235
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,519
What's up? What's the rush?

236
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,320
Well, it's just that...

237
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:34,120
Something came up with Ms. Dan.

238
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,039
I have to leave.

239
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:37,519
But I haven't had enough of this fish.

240
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,679
You guys have to finish it for me.

241
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:39,639
Don't leave a single bite!

242
00:14:39,639 --> 00:14:40,080
All right.

243
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:42,240
Fine, fine, put it down and go.

244
00:14:42,279 --> 00:14:43,080
Go take care of your business.

245
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:43,320
Go on.

246
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:45,080
Okay, okay, I'm heading out.

247
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:45,840
See you.

248
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,559
Take care.

249
00:14:57,679 --> 00:14:58,480
Yes, hello.

250
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:00,519
I placed the order.

251
00:15:00,919 --> 00:15:02,679
I left the key at the front desk.

252
00:15:02,679 --> 00:15:04,240
I've already let them know.

253
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:07,559
From the Plato Hotel to Hongli...

254
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,600
Okay, thanks.

255
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,759
I'm fine, Mr. Sun.

256
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,919
No rush.

257
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:18,360
I'm really okay.

258
00:15:18,799 --> 00:15:19,919
Really, I'm fine.

259
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:22,039
I'll drive you home. My car is right up front.

260
00:15:22,039 --> 00:15:23,279
No need, Mr. Sun.

261
00:15:23,279 --> 00:15:25,039
You head on back. My assistant will be here soon.

262
00:15:25,039 --> 00:15:25,840
What assistant?

263
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,720
Come on, get in my car.

264
00:15:26,879 --> 00:15:28,679
Mr. Sun, really, no.

265
00:15:29,399 --> 00:15:30,200
How about this?

266
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,840
Let's find a hotel nearby

267
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:32,919
and get some rest.

268
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:33,720
No.

269
00:15:34,159 --> 00:15:34,840
Ms. Dan.

270
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,639
Anda, what took you so long?

271
00:15:36,639 --> 00:15:37,120
Sorry I'm late.

272
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:37,919
Who are you?

273
00:15:37,919 --> 00:15:39,919
Um, I'm Anda.

274
00:15:39,919 --> 00:15:40,639
Hello.

275
00:15:40,679 --> 00:15:41,759
Tonight...

276
00:15:41,759 --> 00:15:43,080
if our hosting fell short in any way at the banquet,

277
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:44,279
I'm truly sorry.

278
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:46,919
I've called a car for you.

279
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,399
It's almost here.

280
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,879
Why did you call a car?

281
00:15:49,879 --> 00:15:52,080
I have a car. I can drive you guys!

282
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:54,120
Come on, you've had so much to drink.

283
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,759
How can you drive, right?

284
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:56,960
As for your car, I already arranged

285
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:58,679
a designated driver to take it to your office.

286
00:15:58,679 --> 00:16:00,159
This car will take you home.

287
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,200
I'll see her home first.

288
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:02,519
Goodbye, Mr. Sun.

289
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:04,919
Just left like that?

290
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,120
What...

291
00:16:06,159 --> 00:16:07,360
What is going on here?

292
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:39,159
Here, take this.

293
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:43,919
Why are you giving me this?

294
00:16:44,919 --> 00:16:46,360
Since there might be danger,

295
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,080
we have to be prepared.

296
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,519
But this...

297
00:16:49,519 --> 00:16:51,679
isn't it an ornament from those tribespeople?

298
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,240
What good is it to me?

299
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:57,480
It's a warrior's medal from a tribe.

300
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,159
Only a true warrior

301
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:01,679
is worthy of this medal.

302
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:22,119
Come in.

303
00:17:27,799 --> 00:17:28,599
Anda.

304
00:17:29,319 --> 00:17:30,079
Xiao Chuan.

305
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,240
How come you're back?

306
00:17:34,599 --> 00:17:36,839
What do you mean, "How come I'm back"?

307
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,359
I don't really like the sound of that.

308
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,599
The days I suffered in Africa

309
00:17:41,599 --> 00:17:42,640
were far more than yours.

310
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,880
Besides, if you can come back,

311
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,079
why can't I?

312
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:48,720
Let me tell you, not only am I back,

313
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,119
I even got promoted.

314
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:52,000
You could say headquarters

315
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,559
recognized and rewarded my work.

316
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:56,680
Thank you, headquarters.

317
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,039
Xiao Chuan.

318
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,720
What did you just say?

319
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:08,680
What did you just call me?

320
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:10,519
Mr. Xiao.

321
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,519
That's more like it.

322
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:15,240
You can't forget proper manners just because you're back.

323
00:18:16,440 --> 00:18:18,519
Though if

324
00:18:19,279 --> 00:18:20,880
it's just the two of us,

325
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:22,440
calling me by my name

326
00:18:22,559 --> 00:18:24,920
actually feels pretty warm.

327
00:18:27,279 --> 00:18:28,119
Here's the situation.

328
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,680
Before I arrived,

329
00:18:30,799 --> 00:18:32,960
our department was already understaffed.

330
00:18:33,079 --> 00:18:34,400
Right now, client accounts

331
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,880
are all handled by Ms. Dan's team.

332
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:39,279
And that's not even within her team's scope.

333
00:18:39,319 --> 00:18:42,440
So I'd like to apply to take over the accounts.

334
00:18:44,079 --> 00:18:47,839
But Mr. Sun seems to think very highly of Ms. Dan

335
00:18:47,839 --> 00:18:49,480
and really appreciates her.

336
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:51,319
He's brought her up to me many times.

337
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,240
Don't worry.

338
00:18:52,519 --> 00:18:55,440
I know what these clients

339
00:18:55,559 --> 00:18:56,559
mean to our company.

340
00:18:57,039 --> 00:18:58,559
I'll build a good relationship with them.

341
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:03,200
Still,

342
00:19:03,559 --> 00:19:05,839
you already have a lot of important tasks on your plate.

343
00:19:06,279 --> 00:19:07,559
Can you really handle all that?

344
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,519
Come on, sit down. Have a seat.

345
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:16,559
Here's how it is.

346
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,759
The company wanted to be considerate

347
00:19:18,759 --> 00:19:20,960
and let me adjust since I just got back.

348
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,799
But I feel

349
00:19:22,799 --> 00:19:24,519
I'm fully ready to take on

350
00:19:24,519 --> 00:19:25,680
major responsibilities now.

351
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:28,680
That works out perfectly.

352
00:19:29,079 --> 00:19:31,440
Right now, Alys Jewelry

353
00:19:31,599 --> 00:19:33,440
is hosting an exhibition at our hotel.

354
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:35,480
Plus, their CEO, Mr. Feng,

355
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:36,839
will also be visiting our hotel.

356
00:19:36,839 --> 00:19:37,920
Although he might not stay

357
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:38,920
at the hotel,

358
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:40,920
we still need to arrange

359
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,359
a very comfortable lounge for him.

360
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:45,279
Along with other related preparations,

361
00:19:45,359 --> 00:19:47,680
I want to hand all of it over to you.

362
00:19:48,079 --> 00:19:49,880
What about Mr. Sun?

363
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:55,079
Don't worry about Mr. Sun for now.

364
00:19:55,079 --> 00:19:57,640
Your main priority is to run

365
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:58,519
the Alys Jewelry exhibition well

366
00:19:58,799 --> 00:20:00,240
and take good care of Mr. Feng.

367
00:20:00,519 --> 00:20:01,880
If you pull off these two tasks,

368
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,279
that'll keep you plenty busy.

369
00:20:03,759 --> 00:20:05,279
As for everything else,

370
00:20:05,279 --> 00:20:07,279
back before I returned to the country,

371
00:20:07,319 --> 00:20:09,319
during that video conference,

372
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,480
we already cleared it with headquarters.

373
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,480
You don't need to worry about that.

374
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,920
I'm looking forward to your performance.

375
00:20:16,079 --> 00:20:16,920
Hopefully,

376
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:19,759
you'll be just as outstanding as you were in Africa.

377
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:27,799
I've wanted to come see you for a while,

378
00:20:27,799 --> 00:20:28,759
but ever since I got back,

379
00:20:28,759 --> 00:20:30,000
my dad hasn't let me catch a break.

380
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,920
How've you been lately?

381
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:32,599
Pretty good.

382
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:35,160
I even went to the office today.

383
00:20:35,319 --> 00:20:36,720
Guess who's back?

384
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:37,759
Who?

385
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:42,799
Mr. Xiao.

386
00:20:43,599 --> 00:20:44,759
How come he's back too?

387
00:20:45,079 --> 00:20:48,119
Not only is he back, he even got promoted.

388
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:50,519
Not bad.

389
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:53,920
That means

390
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:55,880
all our old friends from Africa

391
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,319
are gradually coming back.

392
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,039
Then again,

393
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:03,920
after getting so used to living there,

394
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,599
coming back actually takes some adjusting.

395
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:07,599
Come on, cheers.

396
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:08,519
Cheers.

397
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,440
You...

398
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,200
You go first.

399
00:21:20,519 --> 00:21:21,640
No, you go ahead.

400
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:23,960
Nothing much, really.

401
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,359
I've just been crazy busy since coming back.

402
00:21:26,359 --> 00:21:27,920
Haven't had time to ask how you guys are doing.

403
00:21:28,559 --> 00:21:30,400
It's kind of funny, actually.

404
00:21:30,519 --> 00:21:32,440
Back in Antilocaris,

405
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,599
every morning I woke up,

406
00:21:34,599 --> 00:21:36,920
the first thing on my mind was coming back.

407
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,440
Now that I'm back,

408
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:39,559
I just feel like

409
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:40,960
something's missing.

410
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:42,720
You feel that way too?

411
00:21:46,759 --> 00:21:47,960
I know why.

412
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,200
Why?

413
00:21:49,559 --> 00:21:51,759
It's definitely because I have too much free time.

414
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:53,640
I need to find something to do.

415
00:21:55,079 --> 00:21:57,519
Luo Xi and Uncle Qu went to Zhong An today.

416
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:58,559
They did?

417
00:21:58,559 --> 00:22:00,720
But neither of them joined Zhong An.

418
00:22:00,759 --> 00:22:02,160
They'll just drop by to hang out sometimes.

419
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:04,200
Oh, right, Zuo Feichen joined Zhong An.

420
00:22:04,759 --> 00:22:05,839
He joined too?

421
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,839
Though he seems even busier than me lately.

422
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:11,759
He's taking the recruit training course right now,

423
00:22:11,759 --> 00:22:12,720
but whenever class ends,

424
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:13,839
nobody knows where he disappears to.

425
00:22:14,759 --> 00:22:17,279
Back home, he must be surrounded by pretty girls.

426
00:22:17,279 --> 00:22:18,000
Kept busy.

427
00:22:18,680 --> 00:22:19,559
Probably so.

428
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:22,799
Yesterday, I got mugged.

429
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,400
Mugged?

430
00:22:25,079 --> 00:22:25,920
Are you okay?

431
00:22:25,920 --> 00:22:26,759
I'm fine.

432
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:29,759
My only regret is letting him get away.

433
00:22:29,759 --> 00:22:31,240
You actually fought him?

434
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:34,759
I'm someone who survived

435
00:22:34,799 --> 00:22:36,000
Antilocaris.

436
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,400
Of course I fought back!

437
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:40,920
Was I supposed to let him rob and violate me?

438
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,599
In broad daylight? As if he'd dare.

439
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:47,519
Anyway, because of this incident,

440
00:22:48,559 --> 00:22:49,759
I came up with an idea.

441
00:22:50,079 --> 00:22:50,920
What kind of idea?

442
00:22:59,359 --> 00:23:00,400
Quick, come on in.

443
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:04,319
You're having a private feast behind my back every day.

444
00:23:04,359 --> 00:23:05,640
Do you think that's fair?

445
00:23:05,880 --> 00:23:06,720
My goddess!

446
00:23:06,759 --> 00:23:08,160
Well, you're always so busy,

447
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:10,039
missing out on the Captain's specialty dish.

448
00:23:10,559 --> 00:23:11,960
This looks so good!

449
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:16,759
Dig in.

450
00:23:16,759 --> 00:23:17,559
Where's Shen Yu?

451
00:23:17,559 --> 00:23:19,359
My dad stopped him after work,

452
00:23:19,359 --> 00:23:20,440
saying he needed to talk to him.

453
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:24,400
"Student Shen Yu, don't go home after school!"

454
00:23:30,880 --> 00:23:31,599
I'm here.

455
00:23:31,599 --> 00:23:32,920
Speak of the devil.

456
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:34,400
Talking behind my back?

457
00:23:35,079 --> 00:23:36,400
We were all just talking about you.

458
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:39,000
All the food is served, but the drinks aren't here yet.

459
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,119
Sorry I'm late.

460
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,720
The drinks are right here.

461
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:42,960
Come on, sit down.

462
00:23:44,599 --> 00:23:45,640
What a feast!

463
00:23:45,920 --> 00:23:46,599
Cheers!

464
00:23:46,599 --> 00:23:47,359
Cheers!

465
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:53,000
Not bad.

466
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:53,759
Pretty good.

467
00:23:56,759 --> 00:23:57,920
Come on, eat up.

468
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:02,200
Let's eat.

469
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,319
I don't even know how to tackle this dish.

470
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:08,200
Anda, what made you think of

471
00:24:08,319 --> 00:24:10,559
starting a women's self-defense training class?

472
00:24:12,519 --> 00:24:14,759
It's because of what happened last time.

473
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:20,720
I just feel that in many ways,

474
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:23,799
whether at work or in daily life,

475
00:24:23,799 --> 00:24:25,759
women are still relatively vulnerable.

476
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:28,440
I hope women can learn more about

477
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,240
self-protection awareness,

478
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:33,440
and legal awareness as well.

479
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:35,400
That's a great idea.

480
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,000
I believe

481
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:39,079
women naturally need our protection.

482
00:24:39,079 --> 00:24:41,000
They need everyone's protection.

483
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:43,000
As for this proposal,

484
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:45,160
it's already been approved at the company meeting.

485
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:48,400
So this women's self-defense training class

486
00:24:48,799 --> 00:24:49,559
is currently

487
00:24:49,559 --> 00:24:52,039
organized under our Zhong An Group.

488
00:24:52,279 --> 00:24:54,799
Anda will serve as the lead instructor.

489
00:24:56,279 --> 00:25:00,000
As for the other instructors,

490
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:01,039
we actually...

491
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:04,759
For instructors, we'd like to

492
00:25:05,599 --> 00:25:09,119
invite all of you here to teach.

493
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:14,359
Did you two plan this together?

494
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:20,000
So, do you agree?

495
00:25:24,319 --> 00:25:25,119
I'm in.

496
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,000
Awesome!

497
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:29,000
Wait, count me out.

498
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,759
I'm still just a trainee.

499
00:25:30,759 --> 00:25:32,400
I can't teach anything. I can't be an instructor.

500
00:25:32,799 --> 00:25:33,599
Boss Zuo.

501
00:25:33,720 --> 00:25:36,480
You've been acting so mysterious all day.

502
00:25:36,480 --> 00:25:37,319
What are you up to?

503
00:25:38,079 --> 00:25:38,920
What do you mean?

504
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,160
I haven't done anything.

505
00:25:40,599 --> 00:25:41,960
Hey Anda, where were we?

506
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:42,720
The training class, right?

507
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:43,920
Go on, tell us about the class.

508
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:46,039
Neither of you is getting off the hook.

509
00:25:46,480 --> 00:25:48,519
You two will handle the combat training.

510
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:51,200
The two of us teaching women?

511
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:53,880
No way.

512
00:25:54,599 --> 00:25:56,000
Aren't women too much trouble?

513
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:56,839
Of course they are.

514
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:59,759
Men and women should keep their distance. Can't do it.

515
00:26:00,279 --> 00:26:03,039
Come on. If someone else said that, I'd believe it.

516
00:26:03,119 --> 00:26:04,519
Coming from you? Not a chance.

517
00:26:04,519 --> 00:26:06,000
Wait, why wouldn't you believe me...

518
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:08,440
Hey, let Anda finish first.

519
00:26:09,079 --> 00:26:09,799
Right?

520
00:26:09,799 --> 00:26:13,359
Here's the plan. We want to use Zhong An's website

521
00:26:13,599 --> 00:26:16,000
for some basic promotion and recruiting trainees,

522
00:26:16,119 --> 00:26:17,599
along with on-site training sessions.

523
00:26:18,079 --> 00:26:21,160
The on-site sessions will have a strong public-welfare focus.

524
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:24,160
Of course, for this project to happen,

525
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,759
we really have to thank President Xiang.

526
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,000
Don't mention it.

527
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:29,799
I meant your dad.

528
00:26:34,119 --> 00:26:34,920
Hey, wait a minute.

529
00:26:35,319 --> 00:26:38,359
My dad may have approved the project,

530
00:26:38,480 --> 00:26:40,759
but all the running around and hard work,

531
00:26:40,759 --> 00:26:41,960
I did all of that.

532
00:26:42,799 --> 00:26:45,200
Don't you think you owe me

533
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,759
a little token of appreciation?

534
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:48,000
A token of appreciation?

535
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:48,680
Cheers!

536
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:49,680
Come on, everyone together!

537
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:50,920
Come on, cheers!

538
00:26:56,759 --> 00:26:58,039
Welcome! Please come in.

539
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:59,160
Please come in.

540
00:27:00,079 --> 00:27:01,279
Thank you so much.

541
00:27:01,279 --> 00:27:02,119
Please, come on in.

542
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:03,000
Thank you.

543
00:27:03,519 --> 00:27:05,119
Thank you. Please come in.

544
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,200
Anda.

545
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,400
You actually showed up!

546
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:09,599
I thought you wouldn't come.

547
00:27:09,759 --> 00:27:11,640
I said I'd join your training class.

548
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,920
Did you think I was joking?

549
00:27:13,519 --> 00:27:14,519
Quick, please come in.

550
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,680
Come on in.

551
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:27,720
Quiet down, everyone.

552
00:27:28,400 --> 00:27:31,759
First, thank you all for trusting us

553
00:27:32,119 --> 00:27:33,759
and joining our inaugural

554
00:27:33,759 --> 00:27:35,440
women's self-defense training class.

555
00:27:35,799 --> 00:27:37,759
Our training is divided into two parts.

556
00:27:37,759 --> 00:27:40,559
The first part covers laws and regulations,

557
00:27:40,839 --> 00:27:41,599
and the second part

558
00:27:41,599 --> 00:27:44,000
focuses on practical self-defense combat.

559
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:47,119
In a moment, we'll invite Zhong An Group's

560
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:49,400
Mr. Xiang Bei to say a few words.

561
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:51,960
Xiang Bei?

562
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:54,200
He's Zhong An Group's new Young Marshal!

563
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:55,079
He's so handsome!

564
00:27:55,079 --> 00:27:55,759
Young Marshal?

565
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:58,559
The second son of Zhong An's CEO, Xiang Pingsheng!

566
00:27:58,559 --> 00:27:59,240
That's right.

567
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,200
Really?

568
00:28:00,319 --> 00:28:01,400
But I heard...

569
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:03,519
doesn't Xiang Pingsheng have an older son?

570
00:28:03,960 --> 00:28:05,519
Someone at Zhong An told me

571
00:28:05,599 --> 00:28:07,960
his eldest son was killed in Africa.

572
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:12,000
We get to see Xiang Bei!

573
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:13,359
I'm so thrilled!

574
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:18,599
I'm fine, I'm fine.

575
00:28:21,079 --> 00:28:23,960
Ms. Dan, don't drink so much next time.

576
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:25,400
All right, all right.

577
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:29,680
Anda.

578
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:32,960
Actually, I want to confirm something with you.

579
00:28:33,759 --> 00:28:35,039
Last time, you told me

580
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:37,839
that Xiang Lai died in Africa.

581
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,240
Is that true?

582
00:28:46,519 --> 00:28:49,559
Did you drink this much because of that?

583
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:55,960
I can't accept it.

584
00:28:57,799 --> 00:28:59,240
I really can't accept it.

585
00:28:59,559 --> 00:29:01,000
The person who just rescued me

586
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,000
from those thugs...

587
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,759
He's... he's just gone like that.

588
00:29:04,279 --> 00:29:05,079
I...

589
00:29:09,799 --> 00:29:13,039
Actually, there's another reason I came back.

590
00:29:14,920 --> 00:29:16,440
I didn't want to stay there

591
00:29:17,359 --> 00:29:19,319
and be reminded of painful memories,

592
00:29:19,319 --> 00:29:20,799
seeing familiar places

593
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:23,759
and thinking of someone who breaks my heart.

594
00:29:26,359 --> 00:29:30,400
Silly girl, don't be sad like me.

595
00:29:31,279 --> 00:29:32,960
We women are vulnerable.

596
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:35,359
No one protects us anymore,

597
00:29:35,519 --> 00:29:37,440
so we have to protect ourselves.

598
00:29:44,559 --> 00:29:45,720
Let's take a look.

599
00:29:45,799 --> 00:29:46,880
Among these options,

600
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:49,599
which ones fall under the legal definition

601
00:29:49,599 --> 00:29:50,920
of sexual harassment?

602
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,799
A definitely is.

603
00:29:57,759 --> 00:29:59,920
Don't you think so?

604
00:30:00,599 --> 00:30:02,319
Well, I think so.

605
00:30:02,519 --> 00:30:03,400
Yeah, I think so too.

606
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:08,160
But this one definitely is.

607
00:30:08,799 --> 00:30:09,680
Option B?

608
00:30:10,559 --> 00:30:12,359
Probably not.

609
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:15,400
No, I think B counts too.

610
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:17,599
I think both of them are.

611
00:30:17,599 --> 00:30:18,240
Well...

612
00:30:18,759 --> 00:30:21,319
But B only sent explicit pictures.

613
00:30:21,400 --> 00:30:22,519
There wasn't really anything...

614
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:24,920
Plus, there was no physical contact.

615
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:26,799
Aren't pictures even more direct?

616
00:30:27,759 --> 00:30:29,119
Exactly. That's definitely it.

617
00:30:29,119 --> 00:30:31,160
So does it count or not?

618
00:30:31,359 --> 00:30:33,039
All right, now let's see

619
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:35,039
what the law says.

620
00:30:36,279 --> 00:30:37,519
Under the law,

621
00:30:37,799 --> 00:30:40,359
it is prohibited to use any form of speech,

622
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:44,160
writing, images, electronic messages,

623
00:30:44,279 --> 00:30:45,559
or physical conduct

624
00:30:45,960 --> 00:30:48,799
to sexually harass women in any way.

625
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,440
What this means is,

626
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:53,160
apart from physical contact,

627
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:55,400
if someone

628
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:58,279
sends you sexually explicit texts,

629
00:30:58,279 --> 00:30:59,599
images, or messages,

630
00:30:59,960 --> 00:31:01,599
that also constitutes sexual harassment.

631
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,000
When that happens,

632
00:31:03,079 --> 00:31:04,640
you can use the weapon of the law

633
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:05,519
to protect yourself.

634
00:31:05,519 --> 00:31:07,599
Oh, I see! I had no idea.

635
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:12,400
This is a defense spray.

636
00:31:13,759 --> 00:31:16,359
It's something that often comes up

637
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:18,200
in women's self-defense.

638
00:31:19,119 --> 00:31:20,599
It primarily causes

639
00:31:21,119 --> 00:31:23,720
five minutes of temporary blindness,

640
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:27,400
but it won't cause

641
00:31:27,400 --> 00:31:29,319
any permanent damage to the eyes.

642
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:31,640
Now, as for this item,

643
00:31:32,079 --> 00:31:33,720
in our everyday lives,

644
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:35,039
we don't usually carry it around.

645
00:31:36,279 --> 00:31:39,200
In fact, in daily life,

646
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,640
there are plenty of everyday objects that,

647
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:45,119
if used properly,

648
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:48,319
can be very, very effective—

649
00:31:48,599 --> 00:31:51,240
great tools for self-defense.

650
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:53,559
Today in our Zhong An women's training program,

651
00:31:53,559 --> 00:31:54,559
we have a boxing class.

652
00:31:55,119 --> 00:31:56,640
This is our instructor, Xiang Bei.

653
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:57,960
Please give him a warm welcome.

654
00:32:01,759 --> 00:32:03,400
Instructor Xiang, let's begin.

655
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:04,079
All right.

656
00:32:05,799 --> 00:32:06,759
Combat ready!

657
00:32:13,279 --> 00:32:14,079
Begin!

658
00:32:23,599 --> 00:32:24,400
Wait.

659
00:32:24,519 --> 00:32:25,680
Remember, when you punch,

660
00:32:25,680 --> 00:32:26,759
it has to be like this.

661
00:32:27,119 --> 00:32:28,400
You have to tuck your arm in.

662
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:30,200
Use the power from your hips to rotate.

663
00:32:30,559 --> 00:32:31,559
Right, rotate.

664
00:32:31,799 --> 00:32:33,160
And keep your eyes on the opponent.

665
00:32:33,279 --> 00:32:35,119
When you punch, extend and snap back.

666
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:37,000
Punch out, pull back.

667
00:32:37,079 --> 00:32:38,440
Okay? Try it again.

668
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:41,839
Right, right. Rotate.

669
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,640
Nice! Keep it up!

670
00:33:40,079 --> 00:33:41,119
Didn't I tell you

671
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:43,400
you don't need to stay here all day?

672
00:33:43,519 --> 00:33:44,799
Go rest in my office.

673
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:47,000
Today's the first full day of classes.

674
00:33:47,119 --> 00:33:48,960
I'm the class advisor, of course I'd come.

675
00:33:49,279 --> 00:33:51,000
Besides, what if an issue comes up?

676
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:51,920
Don't worry.

677
00:33:52,119 --> 00:33:53,960
The instructors here are all top-notch.

678
00:33:54,319 --> 00:33:56,359
Besides, with me here, what's there to worry about?

679
00:33:57,880 --> 00:33:59,319
Let's go have dinner tonight

680
00:33:59,319 --> 00:34:00,799
at Sister Luo Xi and Uncle Qu's place.

681
00:34:00,799 --> 00:34:01,720
Tonight?

682
00:34:02,759 --> 00:34:04,319
What, got plans?

683
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:05,519
No plans.

684
00:34:06,079 --> 00:34:07,960
Even if I did, it depends on what it is.

685
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:08,719
Right?

686
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,719
All right, I'm off.

687
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:11,800
Go ahead.

688
00:34:24,880 --> 00:34:25,760
Welcome.

689
00:34:25,760 --> 00:34:26,559
Hello.

690
00:34:34,119 --> 00:34:35,639
The room has been cleaned.

691
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:37,360
The flowers are ready, too.

692
00:36:04,599 --> 00:36:05,519
Faster, faster!

693
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:07,519
Pick up the pace! Hurry up, everyone!

694
00:36:07,880 --> 00:36:09,400
Time to sprint! Let's go!

695
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:17,079
Nice job, Helen!

696
00:36:17,079 --> 00:36:18,760
Keep this up and you've got this!

697
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:23,159
I can't...

698
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:26,239
I've got good news for you all.

699
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:27,880
For this year's baseball tournament,

700
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:29,119
we've been invited!

701
00:36:29,519 --> 00:36:30,320
The city has invited us

702
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:32,599
to Africa for an international friendly match.

703
00:36:33,119 --> 00:36:34,880
It's scheduled for the 17th of next month.

704
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:36,159
Don't slack off, everyone.

705
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:38,320
Keep up this great momentum.

706
00:36:38,599 --> 00:36:39,760
Rankings don't matter.

707
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:41,000
What matters most is your mindset,

708
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:41,679
and also...

709
00:36:41,679 --> 00:36:43,320
the conviction to never back down.

710
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:49,800
Coach Cheng.

711
00:36:51,519 --> 00:36:52,400
Coach Cheng...

712
00:36:54,119 --> 00:36:55,599
Don't get up. Just lie back down.

713
00:36:57,559 --> 00:36:58,920
I'm sorry, Coach.

714
00:36:59,880 --> 00:37:02,039
I know I shouldn't have gotten sick now.

715
00:37:02,719 --> 00:37:03,960
I'm holding everyone back.

716
00:37:03,960 --> 00:37:06,400
It's okay. I know you didn't mean to catch a cold.

717
00:37:06,679 --> 00:37:07,960
Don't blame yourself or feel guilty.

718
00:37:08,559 --> 00:37:09,880
Once you get well,

719
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:11,440
you can jump right back into training and matches.

720
00:37:16,320 --> 00:37:17,119
Coach...

721
00:37:17,519 --> 00:37:20,400
Then I'll wait at home for your triumphant return.

722
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:22,760
Sure. What souvenir would you like?

723
00:37:23,079 --> 00:37:24,199
I'll bring it back for you.

724
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:29,440
Actually, what I want is right on you.

725
00:37:29,559 --> 00:37:31,199
On me? What is it?

726
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:35,199
I want the stopwatch you're wearing.

727
00:37:35,599 --> 00:37:37,719
That way, I can always remind myself

728
00:37:38,599 --> 00:37:41,199
to make every second count and never slack off.

729
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,239
No problem.

730
00:37:43,079 --> 00:37:44,280
As long as you keep that spirit,

731
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,800
you'll definitely make it back to the field.

732
00:37:46,119 --> 00:37:48,800
Remember, never lose that conviction to never back down.

733
00:37:56,559 --> 00:37:57,559
Thank you, Coach.

734
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:10,559
This is a live report.

735
00:38:10,559 --> 00:38:12,800
At 20:00 local African time,

736
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:14,400
Risfis Garden Stadium

737
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:16,559
was hit by a terrorist bomb attack.

738
00:38:16,559 --> 00:38:17,840
According to preliminary reports,

739
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:18,880
the bomb attack

740
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,760
has killed 28 people so far,

741
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:21,960
with 76 injured.

742
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:24,280
No individual or organization

743
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:25,920
has yet claimed responsibility.

744
00:38:26,199 --> 00:38:28,360
Our embassy and the local police

745
00:38:28,360 --> 00:38:29,679
have held active discussions

746
00:38:29,679 --> 00:38:31,960
regarding the bombing.

747
00:38:32,159 --> 00:38:33,719
Now let's turn to the footage

748
00:38:33,719 --> 00:38:34,840
sent back by our on-site reporter.

749
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:37,000
Wake up. Wake up.

750
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:32,599
Yan Yan.

751
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:34,960
Hello, Auntie.

752
00:39:35,559 --> 00:39:38,119
Hi, Yan Yan. That's such a pretty dress.

753
00:39:38,400 --> 00:39:41,840
Mom said Dad loved pink dresses best.

754
00:39:44,519 --> 00:39:46,800
Time flies. Yan Yan has grown so much.

755
00:39:47,119 --> 00:39:50,360
Yeah. It's nice seeing kids grow every day.

756
00:39:50,559 --> 00:39:51,960
They're the real future.

757
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:53,599
Actually, so are we.

758
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,039
We all have to look ahead.

759
00:39:57,559 --> 00:39:58,840
Look at this support group.

760
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,840
Last year, there were over 40 people.

761
00:40:01,199 --> 00:40:02,800
This year, only 20-some are left.

762
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:06,159
Yeah. Several years have flown by just like that.

763
00:40:06,800 --> 00:40:08,199
Everyone needs to move on.

764
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:09,760
Helen, you too.

765
00:40:15,559 --> 00:40:17,199
I've checked. The venue is all clear.

766
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,760
I'll go check outside.

767
00:40:51,559 --> 00:40:52,920
May I see your IDs, please?

768
00:40:53,039 --> 00:40:53,840
Here you go.

769
00:40:54,559 --> 00:40:55,280
Thank you very much

770
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:56,400
for staying with us again.

771
00:40:56,800 --> 00:40:58,800
You still prefer the top-floor east-wing room,

772
00:40:58,800 --> 00:41:00,400
and only soda water, right?

773
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:01,920
Yes, same as always.

774
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:02,639
All right.

775
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,320
However, the rooms you booked

776
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:05,400
are still being cleaned,

777
00:41:05,599 --> 00:41:06,840
so I must ask you to wait a moment.

778
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:09,239
Is the rehearsal hall ready?

779
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,920
It's been ready for you for a while.

780
00:41:12,519 --> 00:41:13,440
Here are your IDs.

781
00:41:14,840 --> 00:41:15,639
Let's go.

782
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:24,960
Wait a second.

783
00:41:31,719 --> 00:41:33,400
Didn't a shipment of red wine just arrive?

784
00:41:33,599 --> 00:41:35,639
I heard a celebrity is here to perform.

785
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:38,599
There'll definitely be plenty of girls drinking tonight.

786
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:39,920
Good luck to you.

787
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:06,440
How are you doing? Do you want to take a break?

788
00:43:08,519 --> 00:43:09,400
I'm fine.

789
00:43:11,719 --> 00:43:13,199
I think you were right earlier.

790
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:15,800
We all have to move on.

791
00:43:19,360 --> 00:43:20,559
I think I can.

792
00:43:21,119 --> 00:43:23,159
Helen, you're really brave.

793
00:43:23,679 --> 00:43:25,360
Not only did you accept reality,

794
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:26,760
you even joined Zhong An.

795
00:43:27,360 --> 00:43:30,400
Every year, you volunteer to help the support group

796
00:43:30,599 --> 00:43:32,000
with security work.

797
00:43:32,760 --> 00:43:34,280
I believe we can definitely

798
00:43:34,280 --> 00:43:35,840
step out of the shadows together.
